00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:19,980
This is the one where tit for tat, he had won, you may have heard him tell it.

334
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:23,980
I think in the original line of Axelrod said, and there's one economist who said never cooperate,

335
00:15:23,980 --> 00:15:25,980
and that was Tullock, actually.

